<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Nestle, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,625.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	7.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.40 CHF		  GEARING	18.09 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	26.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,592.00 CHF --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
